# What: Files Git must not track in this CAP project: dependencies, build output, archives,
#     local credentials and SQLite files.
# Why: Definition of Done [CAP-S09] - the folder must stay safe when copied out as a standalone
#     project; credentials belong to bindings, not to Git.
# If missing or unlinked: node_modules, gen/, .mtar archives or default-env.json / .env with
#     real credentials can be committed.
node_modules/
gen/
mta_archives/
dist/
*.mtar
default-env.json
.cdsrc-private.json
.env
.env.*
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.db
coverage/
resources/
